HOW THIS INVENTORY WAS ESTABLISHED
----------------------------------
The components listed below were obtained by resolving the Gradle
configuration `iosArm64CompileKlibraries` of the `:shared` module at version
2.0.0. Versions shown are the RESOLVED versions after Gradle conflict
arbitration, not the declared versions. Where arbitration occurred it is
noted in the entry.

This inventory MUST be regenerated for every release, using:

    ./gradlew :shared:dependencies \
        --configuration iosArm64CompileKlibraries

Note: the configuration is NOT named `iosArm64RuntimeClasspath`; Kotlin/Native
targets do not expose JVM-style runtime classpath configurations.


